## Removing Footnotes

Footnotes are removed the same way through the `~~GT.rm_footnotes()` method. Called without
arguments, all footnotes are removed. The `footnotes=` argument accepts a `0`-based index or a list
of indices when you want to remove specific ones while keeping the rest.

::: {#ea6f497e .cell execution_count=6}
``` {.python .cell-code}
gt_tbl.rm_footnotes()
```

