## Removing Spanners

Spanners are removed with `~~GT.rm_spanners()`, which takes away the spanner labels while leaving
the underlying columns untouched. With no arguments, all spanners are removed. To target specific
ones, pass their ID values to the `spanners=` argument.

::: {#ff204db7 .cell execution_count=7}
``` {.python .cell-code}
gt_tbl.rm_spanners(spanners="performance")
```

